  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to the Association for Strengthening Agricultural Research in Eastern and Central Africa (ASARECA)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the MDTF is to support a program of integrated  agricultural research for development (IAR4D) as described in  ASARECA&apos;s Operational Plancomma resulting in more effective use of  resources devoted to agricultural research among the member countries  and wider access to the results of research in the regional  agricultural systems of Eastern and Central Africa.  The MDTF will  finance activities that will enable the delivery of the results stated  below between 2008-2013. The MDTF will contribute to enhanced  utilisation of agricultural research and development innovations in  Eastern and Central Africa.</narrative>
  </description>
